 "text": "# Tabelas\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Conteúdo\nHuman version (rendered examples): conteudo/tabelas.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\n.table e variantes aplicam o visual de tabela do jogo.\n\n## Básica\n\n```\n<table class=\"table\">\n  <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Qtd</th><th>Preço</th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Poção Vermelha</td><td>12</td><td>50 z</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Asa de Mosca</td><td>5</td><td>60 z</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Asa de Borboleta</td><td>1</td><td>300 z</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n```\n\n## Variações\n\n```\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-sm\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>#</th>\n      <th>Nome</th>\n      <th>Lv</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>Ana</td>\n      <td>99</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>Bia</td>\n      <td>50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-primary\">\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>Cris</td>\n      <td>10</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-danger\">\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>Dani</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n```\n\nClasses de linha/célula contextuais (table-primary, table-success, table-danger...) usam as cores do Bootstrap.\n\n## Responsiva\n\n```\n<div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table\">…</table></div>\n```\n\n## Nativa do kit\n\nSem Bootstrap, a classe cro-table (ou o elemento <table> nu) tem o mesmo visual. Veja Árvore, menu e lista.\n\n## Todas as variações\n\n```\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n  <caption class=\"caption-top\">table-bordered com caption-top</caption>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>A</th>\n      <th>B</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"table table-borderless\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>table-borderless</td>\n      <td>x</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"table table-dark\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>table-dark</td>\n      <td>x</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"table table-striped-columns\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>striped</td>\n      <td>columns</td>\n      <td>x</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>a</td>\n      <td>b</td>\n      <td>c</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"table\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Cabeçalho</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody class=\"table-group-divider\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>table-group-divider</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"table\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr class=\"table-active\">\n      <td>table-active</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-secondary\">\n      <td>table-secondary</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-info\">\n      <td>table-info</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-warning\">\n      <td>table-warning</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-light\">\n      <td>table-light</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"table-dark\">\n      <td>table-dark (linha)</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n```\n\nTabelas responsivas por breakpoint: table-responsive-sm, -md, -lg, -xl, -xxl (a rolagem horizontal só aparece abaixo do breakpoint).\n\nNote\n\ntable-dark mantém o fundo escuro do Bootstrap: é a única superfície escura do kit além de navbar-dark e text-bg-dark. Não há modo escuro geral (veja Navegadores e limites).\n\nResponsiva por breakpoint: table-responsive-sm, -md, -lg, -xl, -xxl.\n« Imagens · Figuras »\n",
